id: dark-vassal
name: Dark Vassal
# A Racial Factor: what it asks for, shown beside its Factor Trait and never enforced (the user's).
requirement: Namekian
maximumFactor: 1
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  Born to serve, you were engineered by your Namekian parent to take on a unique form, in order to fulfill the role you have been assigned.
